name: yandex-browser-universal
os: Debian, Ubuntu, AstraLinux, RedHat, Windows
os_family: Debian, RedHat, Windows
version: 202607
release: 1
summary: Install Yandex Browser on Linux and Windows
description: >
  Cross-platform formula to install Yandex Browser.
  On Debian-family systems imports the official apt repository and installs
  the package. On RedHat-family systems imports the official rpm repository
  and installs the package. On Windows installs via Chocolatey by default
  or via a silent installer URL from pillar.
top_level_dir: yandex-browser-universal
